cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt PICAM, please cite it as below."
title: "PICAM — Privileged Access Management Integrated Cloud Adoption Methodology"
version: "0.1"
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: CC-BY-4.0
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Caldas"
    given-names: "João Victor Fernandes"
abstract: >-
  PICAM is a documented, vendor-agnostic, phase-structured methodology to help
  medium-sized companies migrate data and systems to the cloud securely, with
  Privileged Access Management as the integrating axis from the first phase.
  Version 0.1 is a public draft under doctoral validation.
keywords:
  - cloud computing
  - privileged access management
  - cloud adoption methodology
  - medium-sized enterprises
  - design science research
